Prime Minister Shen is now in prison,

288
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,080
but his children

289
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:06,679
disappeared before the Imperial Guards searched the house.

290
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:08,320
This proves that

291
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,320
there is something wrong with the mansion.

292
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:25,200
You took Shen Suhe out of the mansion

293
00:13:25,759 --> 00:13:27,240
to protect her.

294
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:30,120
Why did you send her back to Prince Rui's Mansion?

295
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,759
The Second Prince is capricious.

296
00:13:33,679 --> 00:13:35,799
He might do something outrageous.

297
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:37,759
Look.

298
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,919
It's all in writing.

299
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,120
Isn't Prince Rui's Mansion here?

300
00:13:43,799 --> 00:13:44,960
Why is she going there?

301
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,039
Send more people to follow her.

302
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:50,200
Unless her life is in danger,

303
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,720
don't take any action.

304
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,240
I'll go to my mother.

305
00:13:58,559 --> 00:13:59,720
This figure

306
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,279
looks so familiar.

307
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,519
Thank you for seeing me.

308
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,320
You don't need to

309
00:14:21,639 --> 00:14:22,399
say that.

310
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:24,840
I believe in my teacher.

311
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,200
He must have been set up

312
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:28,360
by someone else.

313
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,120
I heard last night

314
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,960
that you and Young Master Shen were missing.

315
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,360
I thought something had happened to you.

316
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,240
Glad you're safe.

317
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,360
Don't worry, Zhao.

318
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,440
My brother and I are both safe.

319
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:42,879
I took the risk to come to you

320
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:44,039
to ask

321
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,679
what happened to my father.

322
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,679
Why did His Majesty suddenly punish him?

323
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,000
I don't know what happened.

324
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,440
I only know that

325
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:56,120
before General Xiao was arrested,

326
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:58,960
Qianzhi had a long secret talk with father.

327
00:14:59,799 --> 00:15:01,399
It's said that he gave father a secret letter.

328
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,519
It was written by Xiao Wei himself.

329
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,360
It's about the defeat in the war with the enemy.

330
00:15:07,159 --> 00:15:08,960
It seems to mention your father.

331
00:15:09,559 --> 00:15:10,279
A letter?

332
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:11,679
Father was so angry that

333
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,639
he sentenced General Xiao to death immediately.

334
00:15:14,679 --> 00:15:16,200
But there's no other evidence

335
00:15:16,759 --> 00:15:17,879
to prove the teacher's guilt

336
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,440
except that secret letter.

337
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:22,240
To balance the situation at court,

338
00:15:22,799 --> 00:15:24,240
the Emperor shouldn't deal with him for now.

339
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:26,919
As for you,

340
00:15:28,039 --> 00:15:29,919
Qian is now eyeing the Prime Minister's Residence.

341
00:15:30,799 --> 00:15:32,480
Why don't I find a safe place for you

342
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:33,600
to avoid risks?

343
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,519
That's why

344
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,360
I must return to Prince Rui's Mansion

345
00:15:38,039 --> 00:15:39,639
to find the evidence of his framing of my father.

346
00:15:41,039 --> 00:15:42,039
If you go back now,

347
00:15:42,559 --> 00:15:43,759
wouldn't you be walking into a trap?

348
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,080
It's too dangerous.

349
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:46,679
What about your brother?

350
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:48,840
I have already found a safe place

351
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,200
for him to recover.

352
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:51,759
The Second Prince won't find him.

353
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,320
There are others helping you.

354
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:56,559
He...

355
00:15:59,159 --> 00:16:01,080
Who would still be willing to help us?

356
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,480
Now that the Prime Minister's Residence has fallen on hard times,

357
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,320
no one is willing to lend a hand.

358
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:06,600
Otherwise,

359
00:16:07,039 --> 00:16:08,679
I wouldn't risk coming to see you.

360
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:10,799
So what do you want me to do to help you?

361
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:14,039
Your Highness is the adopted son of the Empress.

362
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:16,039
I want you to go to the Empress

363
00:16:16,399 --> 00:16:17,960
and ask the Emperor for a royal decree.

364
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:19,600
Imperial Edict?

365
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:22,559
Princess Consort,

366
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,480
thank you for sending me back.

367
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,919
As for Empress,

368
00:16:30,679 --> 00:16:31,759
I'm counting on you.

369
00:16:32,279 --> 00:16:32,799
Don't worry.

370
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,240
I'll do my best.

371
00:16:34,679 --> 00:16:35,559
But can you really handle it

372
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:36,679
all by yourself?

373
00:16:37,799 --> 00:16:38,440
Don't worry.

374
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,200
Since I dare to come back,

375
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,759
I must have a way to deal with it.

376
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:44,960
Alright.

377
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:46,320
If

378
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,120
you have any difficulties,

379
00:16:48,799 --> 00:16:49,600
remember to tell me.

380
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,159
Shen Suhe,

381
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:02,399
you dare to come back.

382
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:05,440
This is the Prince Rui's Mansion,

383
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,279
and I am still the Princess Consort of Rui.

384
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,400
I'm not afraid to come back to my home.

385
00:17:11,799 --> 00:17:13,599
Where are you hiding Shen Subai?

386
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,039
I want to ask you the same question.

387
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,160
Where did you take my brother?

388
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:20,359
How dare you frame me!

389
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,920
You killed one of my guards last night.

390
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:24,599
Where are you hiding my brother?

391
00:17:25,319 --> 00:17:26,480
Who's helping you from behind?

392
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,640
You just said my brother is missing.

393
00:17:30,279 --> 00:17:30,960
But yesterday,

394
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,640
you stormed into the PM's Mansion with guards.

395
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,519
The people around saw it all.

396
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,920
I wonder if you took my brother away

397
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:40,920
to kill him in advance

398
00:17:41,279 --> 00:17:42,519
or for some other purpose.

399
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,039
Shen Suhe,

400
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,599
you are a stubborn person.

401
00:17:47,359 --> 00:17:48,559
Your father has been imprisoned.

402
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,000
You're no longer the legitimate daughter of the Prime Minister.

403
00:17:51,839 --> 00:17:52,960
Who do you think you are?

404
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,480
Who am I?

405
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,839
I'm the Princess Consort of Rui

406
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:03,640
who was married to you by the Emperor.

407
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,720
If you hurt me,

408
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,400
you'll disobey His Majesty.

409
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,000
He will hold you accountable.

410
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,359
Don't think you can't be punished

411
00:18:12,359 --> 00:18:13,359
by mentioning my father.

412
00:18:15,079 --> 00:18:15,839
At least,

413
00:18:16,519 --> 00:18:17,640
you are

414
00:18:17,839 --> 00:18:19,440
dying to kill me,

415
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,440
but you can't, right?

416
00:18:24,279 --> 00:18:25,200
From now on,

417
00:18:25,759 --> 00:18:27,559
you must follow Princess Consort Rui.

418
00:18:28,359 --> 00:18:28,720
Yes.

419
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,160
I'll wait outside.

420
00:18:39,079 --> 00:18:39,839
Why are you here?

421
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:41,599
What?

422
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,400
Do I need to inform you in advance

423
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:45,000
if I want to see you now?

424
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,440
You know I didn't mean that.

425
00:18:48,079 --> 00:18:49,519
Prime Minister Shen has been put in prison.

426
00:18:50,359 --> 00:18:52,640
Why do you still keep Shen Suhe in the mansion?

427
00:18:53,519 --> 00:18:55,200
As long as she is my princess consort,

428
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:57,119
she has the right to live in the mansion.

429
00:18:58,119 --> 00:18:59,359
You promised me that

430
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,039
you would kick her out

431
00:19:01,359 --> 00:19:02,440
once the Prime Minister was overthrown.

432
00:19:02,759 --> 00:19:04,319
Are you going to break your promise?

433
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,960
Chuchu, stop making a fuss.

434
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:08,799
The Emperor has only detained the Prime Minister

435
00:19:08,799 --> 00:19:09,839
for interrogation.

436
00:19:10,279 --> 00:19:10,960
How can I kick her out

437
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:12,559
at this juncture?

438
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,480
I don't care.

439
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,279
I don't want to see her now.

440
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,680
Your Highness, you don't even know

441
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,039
how she treated me yesterday.

442
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,559
She almost killed me yesterday.

443
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,440
If it weren't for you yesterday,

444
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,559
how could she have left the mansion?

445
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:24,440
Do you know

446
00:19:24,759 --> 00:19:25,640
that because of your impulsiveness,

447
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,680
you ruined my big plan?

448
00:19:27,039 --> 00:19:27,400
I...

449
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,400
I didn't mean to.

450
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:30,559
All right.

451
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:31,839
Go back and rest.

452
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,039
I have something to deal with.

453
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,519
Your Highness.

454
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,240
Secondary consort.
